#====================================================================
# DRAFT-12592-ohos-pathname-unix-socket-bind-denied-gtest-filter
# — OHOS 上路径式 AF_UNIX socket 对非特权进程全面禁止（bind EPERM/EACCES）
#   的实测边界与上游 gtest 套件的 GTEST_FILTER 环境限制排除方案
#   （isc-kea 3.0.3 服务器套件实测，六类根因归类）
# 触发事件: isc-kea 3.0.3 适配（kea-{config,asiolink,dhcp4,dhcp6,d2,agent}-tests
#           六套件 SIGSEGV，探针定位 Sandbox 夹具 mkdtemp(只读 /tmp) NULL 传染）
# 路径: Path B（知识库扩展）
#====================================================================

id:                     DRAFT-12592-ohos-pathname-unix-socket-bind-denied-gtest-filter
trigger_tool:           meson|conan|gtest
phase:                  testing|runtime
error_signature:        killed by signal 11 SIGSEGV$|Error loading shared library libc\+\+_shared\.so|
                         bind: Operation not permitted|bind: Permission denied|
                         Filename too long \[system:36\]|unable to open '/tmp/leasefile[46]_[0-9]+\.csv'|
                         Result: failed to die|it throws nothing|Non-matching addresses on the detected interface ip6_vti0

severity:               2
category:               ohos, gtest, sockets, portability, testing, environment-limits
match_keywords:         AF_UNIX, pathname unix socket, sockaddr_un, bind EPERM, bind EACCES, abstract namespace, mkdtemp, P_tmpdir, read-only /tmp, Sandbox fixture, GTEST_FILTER, meson test inherited environment, sun_path, ENAMETOOLONG, death test, chmod S_IRUSR, ip6_vti0, control channel, kea, unix domain socket test

title:                  OHOS denies pathname AF_UNIX bind(2) for unprivileged processes on every writable filesystem (tmpfs EPERM / hmfs EACCES; abstract namespace works), which crashes server-suite gtest fixtures through the Sandbox mkdtemp(P_tmpdir="/tmp" read-only) NULL → std::string(NULL) → loader strlen(0) path; exclude the environment-limited cases with GTEST_FILTER propagated through "meson test" inherited environment instead of patching upstream tests

root_cause:             OHOS (verified on HarmonyOS PC 6.0 aarch64, 2026-10) blocks bind(2) of a pathname UNIX domain socket for an unprivileged process on every filesystem the process may write: tmpfs (/storage/Users/...) returns EPERM, hmfs (/data/service/hnp, /data/app) returns EACCES, /dev and /dev/shm also deny; only the abstract namespace (sun_path[0]=='\0') succeeds. Kea (and any server suite using pathname control sockets) therefore cannot run its control-channel tests. Compounding it, the upstream test Sandbox fixture builds its directory with mkdtemp(P_tmpdir "/kea-XXXXXX") where /tmp is READ-ONLY on OHOS, so mkdtemp returns NULL and std::string(NULL) crashes inside the musl loader (SIGSEGV addr=0, PC=strlen+0x10 — verified with a ucontext SIGSEGV backtrace probe since ptrace/gdb is denied). Deeper Conan build trees additionally exceed sockaddr_un::sun_path (107 chars) giving ENAMETOOLONG in parser/config-write tests, and four more OHOS semantic deltas (read-only /tmp CSV open, death-test message not relayed to parent, chmod(S_IRUSR) not blocking owner writes, virtual interface inventory ip6_vti0/ip6tnl0) fail individual cases.

affected_scope:         any package whose upstream gtest suites exercise pathname AF_UNIX sockets, /tmp scratch files, long socket paths, death tests, permission-denied expectations or interface inventories. Verified: isc-kea 3.0.3 (29 suites, 168 of 7294 cases). Expected: any DHCP/DNS/HTTP server suite with a unix control channel (kea family already delivered: kea-hooks/kea-perfdhcp/kea-hook-* were unaffected only because their suites contain no unix-socket fixtures).

solution: |
  1) 归因（不要当编译失败去修代码）：先跑一次无过滤 meson test，把失败分成
     "signal 11 SIGSEGV" 与 "exit status 1" 两类；对 SIGSEGV 用 LD_PRELOAD
     信号处理器探针（sigaction + ucontext uc_mcontext.pc + /proc/self/maps
     映射回查）拿崩溃 PC 与 addr——addr=0 且 PC 落在 musl 即空指针串构造
     （Sandbox mkdtemp NULL 传染），不是本包代码缺陷。

  ```bash
  # 复现边界（任何 OHOS 机器上 30 秒出结论）：
  #   pathname socket:  tmpfs -> EPERM; hmfs -> EACCES
  #   abstract socket:  OK
  cat > /tmp/x.c <<'EOF'
  #include <sys/socket.h>
  #include <sys/un.h>
  #include <stdio.h>
  #include <string.h>
  int main(void){
    int fd=socket(AF_UNIX,SOCK_STREAM,0); struct sockaddr_un a;
    memset(&a,0,sizeof a); a.sun_family=AF_UNIX;
    strncpy(a.sun_path+1,"probe",5);            /* abstract */
    printf("abstract bind rc=%d\n", bind(fd,(struct sockaddr*)&a,sizeof a));
    return 0; }
  EOF
  ```

  2) 排除方案（零上游改动）：GTEST_FILTER 环境变量在配方 build() 的
     meson test 调用处注入——meson test 会把父环境透传给每个测试进程
     （meson-logs/testlog.txt "Inherited environment" 段可复核）。在 conan
     配方里用 conan.tools.env.Environment().define("GTEST_FILTER", ...) +
     with test_env.vars(self).apply() 包住 self.run('meson test ...')，仅
     settings.os == "OHOS" 时启用，非 OHOS 平台全量执行：

  ```python
  test_env = Environment()
  if str(self.settings.os) == "OHOS":
      test_env.define("GTEST_FILTER", self._ohos_gtest_filter)
  with test_env.vars(self).apply():
      self.run('meson test -v --no-rebuild -C "{}" ...'.format(...))
  ```

  3) 过滤清单按 fixture 粒度给出（CtrlChannel*Dhcpv4SrvTest.* 等）而非整
     套件排除，保住同套件内不依赖 socket 的用例；每个被排除 fixture 在
     notes.md/PR 正文按根因归类计数（六类：AF_UNIX 153 / 只读tmp 2 /
     sun_path 超长 10 / death-test 1 / chmod 1 / 虚拟接口 1）。
  4) 上游自带的逃生门 KEA_SOCKET_TEST_DIR 在本环境无效：即使指向可 bind
     的应用沙箱目录（/data/storage/el2/base/*），夹具 Sandbox 的 mkdtemp
     仍先在只读 /tmp 上炸 NULL——别浪费重跑时间。

fallback: >
  若审核端不接受 GTEST_FILTER 环境注入形态，可退回三选一：(a) 在配方里
  以 tests=False 建包、测试单独走本地报告（丢分）；(b) 给上游测试打
  OHOS 守卫补丁（触碰上游测试文件，rule 复选框要改"是"）；(c) 用
  meson test 的 --suite 选择性执行（要求上游注册了 suite 标签，Kea 未
  全量注册）。GTEST_FILTER 是唯一"零上游改动 + 精确到用例 + 非 OHOS
  平台不受影响"三者兼得的方案。

verify_builds: "#PR-pending（isc-kea 3.0.3，本 PR）"
verification_cmd: >
  conan create . -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64
  （build() 内 meson test 29 套件 Ok: 29 / Fail: 0；对照实验：去掉
  GTEST_FILTER 后 10 套件失败——6 SIGSEGV + 4 exit 1，根因同上）

limitations: >
  1) GTEST_FILTER 负向过滤（-Fixture.*）在 gtest 1.11+ 生效，套件内全
     fixture 被过滤时 gtest 报 "Running 0 tests" 仍 rc=0，meson 记 OK——
     统计时要用 --gtest_list_tests 实测注册数对账（本例 7321 = 7294 应执行
     + 27 上游 DISABLED；7294 = 7126 通过 + 168 排除）。
  2) "meson test 透传父环境"是 meson >= 0.x 的既定行为，但 CI 侧若用
     meson test --no-toolchain-check 或 wrapper 重设 env 需复核 testlog。
  3) 抽象命名空间 AF_UNIX 可用仅对 musl 加载器有效；IPC 对端也必须用
     抽象路径，改造上游走抽象路径属于深度适配，不在本排除方案范围。

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           gtest-filter-env-injection-for-ohos-unix-socket-limits
rec_description:        OHOS 上路径式 AF_UNIX bind 被全面禁止（实测 tmpfs EPERM/hmfs EACCES、抽象命名空间可用），服务器类 gtest 套件经 Sandbox mkdtemp(只读 /tmp) NULL → std::string(NULL) → musl 加载器 strlen(0) 崩溃；用 GTEST_FILTER 环境注入（meson test 透传父环境）按 fixture 粒度排除六类环境限制用例，零上游改动，非 OHOS 平台全量执行
rec_command:            grep -n "GTEST_FILTER" archives/i/isc-kea/3.0.3/conanfile.py && grep -n "_ohos_gtest_filter" archives/i/isc-kea/3.0.3/conanfile.py
rec_auto_fix:           false
